me":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T01:15:39.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T01:15:39.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH v6 3/3] iio: adc: bcm_iproc_adc: Convert probe error handling to dev_err_probe()","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","displayName":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:32:26 +0300\nAndy Shevchenko <andriy.shevchenko@intel.com> wrote:"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"On Thu, Aug 06, 2026 at 08:09:02AM +0530, mdshahid03@gmail.com wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"> Replace open-coded dev_err() followed by return with dev_err_probe()"},{"depth":1,"text":"> for probe failures that immediately return."},{"depth":1,"text":"> "},{"depth":1,"text":"> Leave error paths that jump to cleanup labels unchanged to reduce code"},{"depth":1,"text":"> churn. These paths will be converted separately together with the"},{"depth":1,"text":"> planned devm-managed cleanup using devm_add_action_or_reset().  "},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"..."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":">  \tadc_priv->regmap = syscon_regmap_lookup_by_phandle(pdev->dev.of_node,"},{"depth":1,"text":">  \t\t\t   \"adc-syscon\");  "},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Size note: the above can be also amended (since you have a 'dev') to"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"\tadc_priv->regmap = syscon_regmap_lookup_by_phandle(dev->of_node,"},{"depth":1,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"adc-syscon\");"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"But we can go even further (in a separate patch) and move it to"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"\tadc_priv->regmap = syscon_regmap_lookup_by_phandle(dev_of_node(dev),"},{"depth":1,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"adc-syscon\");"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"..."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":">  \tadc_priv->adc_clk = devm_clk_get(dev, \"tsc_clk\");"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\tif (IS_ERR(adc_priv->adc_clk)) {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\tdev_err(&pdev->dev,"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\t\t\"failed getting clock tsc_clk\\n\");"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\tret = PTR_ERR(adc_priv->adc_clk);"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\treturn ret;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t}"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +\tif (IS_ERR(adc_priv->adc_clk))"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +\t\treturn dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(adc_priv->adc_clk),"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +\t\t\t\t     \"failed getting clock tsc_clk\\n\");  "},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":">  \tret = clk_prepare_enable(adc_priv->adc_clk);"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\tif (ret) {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\tdev_err(&pdev->dev,"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\t\t\"clk_prepare_enable failed %d\\n\", ret);"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t\treturn ret;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> -\t}"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +\tif (ret)"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +\t\treturn dev_err_probe(dev, ret, \"failed to enable clock\\n\");  "},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"This will be less churn if the previous (new) patch will convert this to use"},{"depth":1,"text":"devn_clk_get_enabled(). But if Jonathan is okay with this patch as is, you"},{"depth":1,"text":"can take my"},{"depth":1,"text":"Reviewed-by: Andy Shevchenko <andriy.shevchenko@intel.com>"}],"lineCount":50,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Too much in my backlog for me to keep track so I'll merge what we have\nhere and a follow up bit of devm_ work can be a separate series (this\ntime - look for similar opportunities if you do similar work\nin future!)"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Series applied to the testing branch of iio.git."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Jonathan"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":1,"maximumDepth":1}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"anmMmrbhUvtmm5xs@ashevche-desk.local"}},"rootIds":["20260816021539.5f95f403@jic23-huawei"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["20260816021539.5f95f403@jic23-huawei"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}